    "Seed 1 only; the final 100 episodes are not 100 independent training seeds.",
    "All three runs have the same 8M annealing horizon, unlike the prior 50M runs.",
    "Wall times/SPS were not measured under an aggregate-throughput protocol, so no optimizer throughput conclusion is drawn."
  ]
